Z||000000||ChadMan||05-07-2001||02:24 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lwf8.jpg"> <BR>Pulling into the Fiero Factory.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lwf6.jpg"> <BR>Most everybody liked the Green Machine.  This picture doesn't do it justice.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lwf7.jpg"> <BR>A beautiful bumper-pad car.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lwf9.jpg"> <BR>Ed's engines...Sixes on the left, Dukes on the right.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lwf10.jpg"> <BR>These Fieros have seen better days.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lwf12.jpg"> <BR>87ECO5 checks out Ed's parts/fixer-upper cars.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lwf13.jpg"> <BR>This 88 GT will soon be even faster.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Eric||05-07-2001||05:11 PM||||Hey, that looks like my 88 GT.  <P>Did you find some springs there Chadman?||||reg||1
Z||000002||ChadMan||05-08-2001||09:03 AM||||No springs, but I did buy a steering rack bushing from Rodney Dickman that should cure my rt-frt wheel slop.  It came with some really good instructions written by Winston Ojeda, the guy who built the LT-1 Fiero...<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fierolt1.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierolt1.com</A> <P>Actually, I will probably stick with my current setup (Y99 springs up front, WS6 out back) as it seems to make the car oversteer more and understeer less.||||reg||1
Z||000003||87ECO5||05-08-2001||09:23 AM||||Excellent pics, ChadMan!  Say, did the photo of me sitting next to my old motor turn out?||||reg||14
Z||000004||FLASHY||05-08-2001||09:43 AM||||"The Chad"<P>sorry, you had to see Charlie's Angels to get that. Nice pics!!||||reg||1
Z||000005||ChadMan||05-08-2001||10:55 AM||||   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lwf5.jpg">   <BR>87ECO5 and his faithful Iron Duke, which he no longer needs because he now has a rebuilt 3.4 bored out to 3.6.<P>I don't know why it looks like there's a notch missing from the left side of your face...must have been something screwy in the TIF-to-JPG conversion.  "Saw lots of notchbacks in Toney but only one notchface..."   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Haven't seen Charlie's Angels yet, so I don't get it.  At least all the chad jokes from the election are over.<p>[This message has been edited by ChadMan (edited 05-08-2001).]||||reg||1
